<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Eltron started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Eltron started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson Humphrey said it started coverage of Eltron International Inc with a near-term rating as market perform and a long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 21-3/4.</p>
